        <op order="1">U_A and U_B latch ID_RD1 and ID_RD2 into RD1_r and RD2_r.</op>
        <op order="2">U_MUX_2to1_A selects A from RD1_r or the alternate 5-bit value; in the current top-level this alternate value is hard-wired to 5'h0.</op>
        <op order="3">U_MUX_3to1_B selects B from RD2_r, EX_Imm32, or sign-extended EX_Offset.</op>
        <op order="4">U_ALU executes the selected ALUOp and produces ALU_result.</op>
        <op order="5">ControlUnit converts ID_NPCOp into flopped branch and EX_NPCOp signals that drive redirect behavior one stage later.</op>
        <op order="6">U_NPC computes NPC from NPC_PC, EX_NPCOp, EX_Offset, EX_Offset20, and RD1_r.</op>
